{%- comment -%}
  fmx-scent-profiling (aaroma.co): copy of magicperfume.co / tryscent.co snippets/fmx-scent-profiling.liquid. The short
  scent description under the claim lines (FM pm-sdesc) from custom.scent_description. No concentration line, no
  quick links ("Full description" / "Clean label"), no icon row (family / occasion / season): the claim lines are the
  selling_points block, family / occasion / season sit in the scent notes section below the buy box (as on
  magicperfume.co). Empty custom.scent_description = nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% if product.metafields.custom.scent_description != blank %}
  <p class="pm-sdesc">
    {{ product.metafields.custom.scent_description }}
  </p>
{% endif %}
